  "id": 5818814778,
  "node_id": "I_kwDOAtRsxM8AAAABWtQROg",
  "number": 1264,
  "title": "\`shell: true\` wrongly escapes pipe character",
  "user": {
   "login": "adworacz",
   "id": 561689,
   "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjU2MTY4OQ==",
   "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/561689?v=4",
   "gravatar_id": "",
   "url": "https://api.github.com/users/adworacz",
   "html_url": "https://github.com/adworacz",
   "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/adworacz/followers",
   "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/adworacz/following{/other_user}",
   "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/adworacz/gists{/gist_id}",
   "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/adworacz/starred{/owner}{/repo}",
   "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/adworacz/subscriptions",
   "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/adworacz/orgs",
   "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/adworacz/repos",
   "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/adworacz/events{/privacy}",
   "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/adworacz/received_events",
   "type": "User",
   "user_view_type": "public",
   "site_admin": false
  },
  "labels": [],
  "state": "closed",
  "locked": false,
  "assignees": [],
  "milestone": null,
  "comments": 0,
  "created_at": "2026-10-12T18:48:57Z",
  "updated_at": "2026-10-13T06:04:54Z",
  "closed_at": "2026-10-13T06:04:54Z",
  "assignee": null,
  "author_association": "NONE",
  "active_lock_reason": null,
  "sub_issues_summary": {
   "total": 0,
   "completed": 0,
   "percent_completed": 0
  },
  "issue_dependencies_summary": {
   "blocked_by": 0,
   "total_blocked_by": 0,
   "blocking": 0,
   "total_blocking": 0
  },
  "body": "Just ran into this.\\n\\nThe following call escapes the \`|\` character, which prevents the shell from actually doing the pipe.\\n\\n\`\`\`ts\\nawait execa({shell: true, verbose: 'short'})\`echo 'foo' | cat\`\\n\`\`\`\\n\\nThe \`verbose\` shows the command is being run as:\\n\\n\`\`\`\\n[11:43:34.819] [0] $ echo ''\\\\''foo'\\\\''' '|' cat\\n\`\`\`\\n\\nnote how the pipe is escaped.\\n\\nEdit: I know that using \`shell: true\` is not recommended, but I do piping of large amounts of data on limited resource machines, and the performance overhead of NodeJS stream piping is quite significant compared to a plain shell pipe between two processes, even wit… (+18 chars)",
  "closed_by": {
   "login": "sindresorhus",
   "id": 170270,
   "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjE3MDI3MA==",
   "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/170270?v=4",
   "gravatar_id": "",
   "url": "https://api.github.com/users/sindresorhus",
   "html_url": "https://github.com/sindresorhus",
   "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/sindresorhus/followers",
   "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/sindresorhus/following{/other_user}",
   "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/sindresorhus/gists{/gist_id}",
